enough to destroy their relationship.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.720
And it says...

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:54.390
"Sawaragi Shiho likes Katagiri Yuichi."

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.130
Huh?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>yeeees</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>it's happening lol</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>we got one lol</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>yees</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>y tho?</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>about time</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>seriously?</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>hype</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>hey who wrote that?!</b>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.640
<b>Shiho-sama</b>

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.640
S-Seriously?

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.470
W-Why...

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.640
Wait, there's more.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:04.980
"And the same Sawaragi Shiho 
used to date Mikasa Tenji."

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.980
<b>used to date</b>

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.980
<b>Mikasa Tenji</b>

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:14.200
The most popular way to destroy friendship
 between a man and a woman is with romance.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:21.710
Of course, there's no reason to attack 
someone for who they like or once dated.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.210
But it's still a tough issue to parse.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:28.550
And the result of the god survey is here!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.550
