Plus-minus zero? 
So sometimes there's no change.

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:41.930
Yuichi, how can you be so chill?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:42.650
Huh?

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.350
You didn't know Shiho liked you, did you?

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.880
What the...

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:51.530
You knew I liked her. 
Were you both mocking me?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.620
Cut it out. Jealousy isn't 
becoming of a man.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.200
