00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.870
Yes, it does.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:01.950
I'm Shiho-chan's ex. 
I know her very well.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.480
Stop it, Tenji! Don't say it in a way
 people will misunderstand.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:06.640
