00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:10.920
I didn't tell anyone, but Mikasa-kun 
and I were childhood friends.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:15.840
My dad is a police officer and
 Mikasa-kun's dad is a public prosecutor.

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:19.680
They were in the same class in college, 
so our families were very close.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.350
Tenji-kun is the only husband for Shiho.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:25.350
They decided between themselves 
that we should get engaged...

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.350
It'd be great if Shiho-chan 
became my daughter!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:29.860
So we pretended to date, for our parents...

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.770
until Mikasa-kun's dad died two years ago.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:36.090
Then Mikasa-kun changed schools.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.360
It was by chance that we met 
again last year in high school.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>blah blah...</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>huh? what?</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>blah blah...</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>oooh</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>getting complicated</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>parents setting them up sounds like a manga</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>childhood friends win confirmed</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>a secret relationship lol</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.990
<b>fate?</b>

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:44.120
And you call that dating? 
That's a lie, right?

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.250
Hmm. I'm not so sure.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:50.750
If they had no romantic feelings 
at the time, then it might be a lie.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.070
Yes, neither of us—

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.220
I really did like you.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.140
Even now, I'm still in love with you.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>here we go!</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>tell me that's a lie!</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>Mikasa-kuuun!</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>I feel bad for Shibe-kun</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>oh snap!</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>Tenji</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>twu wuv</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>my heart</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.350
<b>a love confession!!</b>

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:05.310
That's why you've always pissed me off, Shibe!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:10.060
I couldn't stand your thoughtless statements 
and attitude toward Sawaragi-san!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.400
Tenji...

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:16.360
Then you should have just told me 
you liked her and to keep my hands off!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:21.030
How could I? I knew
 Sawaragi-san liked Yuichi.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:25.010
Th-That's still no reason 
to write it on the bad-mouth card!

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.440
Huh? You've got to be the one who wrote it!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:31.960
Bullshit! How would anyone else know 
about your and Shiho's past?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:37.010
You're such a simpleton. That would 
make me the number one suspect.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.010
There's no way I wrote it.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:42.480
Shibe, try to think about it a little.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:46.220
You're starting to look like an idiot.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:50.060
Then why would a smart ass 
like you think it's me, Tenji-kun?

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.600
You're jealous.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:57.180
You must have at least heard rumors 
about Sawaragi-san's connection to me and Yuichi.

00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:00.070
You wanted to see if it was true.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:03.310
You're jealous of the
 special connection we have.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:07.280
You're the only one who's 
literally "just a friend."

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.330
Right?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.580
Tenji!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.250
Stop, you idiots!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.860
Break it up!

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:18.130
You both like Sawaragi, right?

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:22.840
Then quit doing things that upset her.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:27.770
So, Shiho-chan, you like Yuichi, don't you?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:28.770
Y-Yeah.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:32.430
And not just Shibe-kun, 
but Mikasa-kun, too...

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:33.190
Yutori...?

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:37.630
The boys all fall for you, Shiho-chan.

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:40.320
I bet Yuichi will, too.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:43.320
Yay! What an absolute mess!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.740
It is quite interesting.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.960
Playing dumb in the midst 
of all that carnage.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:51.580
Whoever wrote that card is 
lying through their teeth.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.580
<b>Fourth Period</b>

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:55.570
I'll go in first.

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:07.280
Okay, I left mine blank. You're next.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.270
All right. I've got this.

