<b>Shibe-kyun lol</b>

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:31.550
Katagiri Yuichi once didn't 
take a bath for a week.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.080
<b>nasty lol</b>

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.080
<b>nasty lol</b>

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.080
<b>how dirty lol</b>

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.080
<b>crying poor tears</b>

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:33.790
Actually, Sawaragi Shiho 
has had plastic surgery.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Q: Who is the most "unforgivable"?</b>

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Shibe Makoto</b>

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Sawaragi Shiho</b>

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Katagiri Yuichi</b>

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Kokorogi Yutori</b>

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Mikasa Tenji</b>

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.090
And the results of the survey are...

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>no kidding...</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>is she that desperate to be popular?</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>say it isn't so, Shiho-sama lol</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>plastic surgery, of course</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>she would, wouldn't she?</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>she left them in the dust</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>that's just sad</b>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.090
<b>Shiho-samaaa</b>

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.600
Of course the plastic surgery 
one's a lie, right Shiho?

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.800
So what if it is true?

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:50.310
If I'd had plastic surgery, 
would you still have liked me?

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:53.230
Would we even have become friends?

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.950
Th-That's not...

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:57.560
If you liked someone of the opposite 
sex who had plastic surgery...

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:01.000
Well, I doubt that would 
destroy the friendship, too.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.530
I don't think that's the case.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.180
Friendship is even more 
calculating than romance.

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.000
Oh?

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:10.760
People make friends to have fun together,

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.740
to stop getting bullied, to get money...

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:17.750
You don't want a friendship 
that has no advantages!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.130
Right.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.370
While there is unconditional love,

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:26.710
there's no such thing as
 an unconditional friendship.

